  "id": "BIT-moodle-2026-102581",
  "summary": "Moodle: xss in forum post templates due to insufficient escaping",
  "details": "A flaw was found in Moodle. Insufficient output escaping in templates used to display forum posts enables a stored cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability. An attacker can inject malicious content into a forum post, which then executes arbitrary script code in the browser of another user viewing the affected post.",
